{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G2-02","example":{"issue":{"title":"鄉區路口，號誌與行人需求是否看得見？","intro":"主要道路約 14 m、次要道路約 10 m，兩側無人行設施。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-02-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-02-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-02-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-02-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"speed","title":"速限提示不足","text":"兩條道路皆缺少清楚的速限標字與標誌。"},{"id":"signal","title":"號誌容易被背景干擾","text":"路側樹林影響辨識，既有標誌標線也需隨現況檢視更新。"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"行人穿越需求被忽略","text":"鄉區路口仍有步行與穿越需求，需一併檢視人行配置。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[53,54],"strategy":{"title":"界定車行範圍，留下路側活動空間","intro":"在鄉區號誌路口，同時整理車道、人行預留空間與路口預告。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-02-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"lanes","title":"先確認車道與方向分隔","text":"以分向限制線及車道配置，說清楚路口前後的行車範圍。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"walking","title":"預留人行與路側使用空間","text":"依鄰近工廠及路側活動需求，整理車行道外的空間，供後續配置人行設施。","moduleId":"M3-01"},{"id":"notice","title":"提早辨識路口與號誌","text":"搭配岔路、路名等提示，並檢查號誌對應位置，提高鄉區路口辨識度。","moduleId":"M2-03"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-2-02-signalized-rural-orthogonal-t.typ","sha256":"294d98073d908c35673411f655073198f1c4a43a1c101ea65c3579cd0cb14ad6","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g2-02-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-02/G2-02_現況圖_01.png","width":3350,"height":1883,"label":"G2-02 現況圖","scenario":"G2-02","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":53,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image47.png","sha256":"31abc7fdcd69d6d80ddd20dd6ecc2666d3cd3ee81e09e93c48dc37ab91529fa0"},"results:g2-02-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-02/G2-02_現況照片_01.png","width":2563,"height":1048,"label":"G2-02 現況照片","scenario":"G2-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":54,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image48.png","sha256":"43057690c7e7613e5d99024644e1767b364f6d70bdde1b3253